<title>ESTONIA: HOIUPANK JULY PROFIT 21.1 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>HOIUPANK JULY PROFIT 21.1 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>July 1997</p>
<p>				   (million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit				    21.1 vs  18.8</p>
<p>Balance sheet volume (billion kroons) 6.65 vs  6.35</p>
<p>Time deposits  (billions of kroons)  1.07  vs  1.16</p>
<p>Deposits total (billions of kroons)  4.71  vs  4.43</p>
<p> Loans	    (billions of kroons)  3.58  vs  3.37</p>
<p> Total own capital			 444.2  vs  423.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Comparisons for the second largest bank in Estonia</p>
<p>are with June.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuter@reuter.ee</p>
